      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef make_windows(values, size):\n    xs = [values[i:i + size] for i in range(len(values) - size)]\n    ys = [values[i + size] for i in range(len(values) - size)]\n    return [xs, ys]\n\nxs, ys = make_windows([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 2)\nprint(xs)\nprint(ys)\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef make_windows(values, size):\n    xs = [values[i:i + size] for i in range(len(values) - size)]\n    ys = [values[i + size] for i in range(len(values) - size)]\n    return [xs, ys]\n\nxs, ys = make_windows([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 2)\nprint(xs)\nprint(ys)\n```"
